# Central daily requests using the QNX target's local clock/timezone.
# Enable: central_controller -l --headless --schedule <this-file>
# Format: HH:MM fixed|sensor I1..I6|all
# Illustrative peak/off-peak times; justify actual times in the group report.
# Latest applicable row wins, including previous-day wrap.
# Operator intent wins. Use schedule-resume I1 or schedule-resume all to release.
# Local owns safe transitions, railway protection and temporary-mode expiry.
# File is loaded once at startup and does not change another team's code.

07:00 fixed all
09:30 sensor all
16:30 fixed all
19:00 sensor all
